  Exact source archives, hashes and licenses are in licenses/media/ and
  tool/media_sources.json; the recipe is tool/build_android_media.sh.
  Android system libc, libm, libdl and libz are supplied by the operating system.
  This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
- media_kit wrappers remain MIT; that does not relicense their native libraries.
  Per-component licenses and notices accompany the native supply, separately
