Android native audio source and license materials
------------------------------------------------
media_kit_libs_android_audio 1.3.8 is an MIT-licensed wrapper; its license does
not relicense bundled native libraries as MIT. Its pubspec.lock SHA256 is
8f8f9759e537e12d66f08bc4d5279eb1bb21a0ccc519ff3442c68a9f3b6dd68b;
the collected pub.dev source archive matches this value.

The wrapper selects the default native artifacts from
media-kit/libmpv-android-audio-build v1.1.8. Original build recipe revision:
87744be8b337c50ed54961249b7a97c5e8cc37c9
https://github.com/media-kit/libmpv-android-audio-build/tree/87744be8b337c50ed54961249b7a97c5e8cc37c9
The unmodified recipe archive retains dependency versions, exact configuration
scripts and the original mpv/FFmpeg patches. Its declared components are:
- mpv 0.35.1: --enable-lgpl; LGPL-2.1-or-later mode, with upstream GPL and
  permissive source-file notices retained. Linked library licenses also apply.
- FFmpeg 6.0 / n6.0: --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree --enable-version3;
  LGPL-3.0-or-later configured static dependency.
  This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
- Mbed TLS 3.6.1: Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later; the Apache-2.0 option is
  compatible with the configured LGPLv3 FFmpeg mode. Its pinned framework
  submodule source is also preserved.
- libxml2 2.10.3: MIT and ISC-style/per-file copyright variants.

